D33B 10ACE4           (adybug/src/main.s):03155                 cmpy    ,s
D33E 25EF             (adybug/src/main.s):03156                 blo     btrow
D340 3262             (adybug/src/main.s):03157                 leas    2,s
D342 35C0             (adybug/src/main.s):03158                 puls    u,pc
